,0,1,2,1,2,10,10,10,1Style: VideoTransmissionCaptions,Roboto,55,&H00193209,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,0,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Kanji-furigana,Duality,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: Translation-furigana,Duality,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Karaoke-furigana,Duality,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1.5,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: Default-furigana,Arial,10,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,1,1,2,10,10,10,1Style: Karaoke,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: Translation,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextComment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,DialogueComment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Credits,,0,0,0,,CreditsComment: 0,0:00:24.64,0:00:24.64,Main,,0,0,0,,OpeningDialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:36.78,Title,,0,0,230,,The Whirl SpiderDialogue: 0,0:02:42.06,0:02:45.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to fight someone as strong as him!Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.11,0:02:47.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I came here to save Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.82,0:02:55.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear Second!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.93,0:03:03.29,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll face this guy!Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.76,0:03:09.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Hawk Eye! Do you remember us?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:12.27,Main,,0,0,0,,We've both challenged you before!Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.94,0:03:21.25,Main,,0,0,0,,But now that we're Newkama, we've powered up!Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.09,0:03:32.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't remember the face of every insect I've crushed.Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.96,0:03:51.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Almost there! Just a little further!Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:04.76,Main,,0,0,0,,You're still in range.Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.38,0:04:20.76,Main,,0,0,0,,T-that hurt...Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:22.41,Main,,0,0,0,,He cut me!Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:28.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Hawk Eye jumped into the air?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:42.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn you!Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.53,0:04:45.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:51.65,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Jet Bazoo-Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.67,0:05:02.08,Main,,0,0,0,,That was too close!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.08,0:05:04.25,Main,,0,0,0,,If I'd stretched my arms, he'd have cut them off!Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.25,0:05:06.76,Main,,0,0,0,,You aren't as reckless as I expected.Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.46,0:05:35.85,Main,,0,0,0,,With just one slash of his sword...Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.32,0:05:39.62,Main,,0,0,0,,He cut that mountain-sized wall of ice!Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:46.69,Main,,0,0,0,,S-so this is what the world's mightiest swordsman is capable of.Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.59,0:05:54.10,Main,,0,0,0,,How freakin' strong is this guy? If he's after Straw Hat, it's all over!Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.41,0:06:02.94,Main,,0,0,0,,The ice is falling this way!Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.27,0:06:26.81,Main,,0,0,0,,You want me to team up with you?Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.05,0:06:31.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop talking to me as if we were equals.Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.59,0:06:35.01,Main,,0,0,0,,You mean you want me to be your underling, right?Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.01,0:06:43.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Just when I thought Impel Down might have rehabilitated you...Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.55,0:06:46.18,Main,,0,0,0,,If it had, I wouldn't have gotten out at all.Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:48.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Sandstorm!Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.78,0:06:51.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Begone, you damn Flamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:04.87,Main,,0,0,0,,And here I thought you'd listen to reason.Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.97,0:07:11.23,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as I can avoid fighting the marines, this'll all go my way!Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.23,0:07:13.78,Main,,0,0,0,,No trouble at all!Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.26,0:07:22.54,Main,,0,0,0,,No trouble! No trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:24.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.78,0:07:28.07,Main,,0,0,0,,How do you keep getting mixed up in other people's fights like that?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:31.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, what will you do?Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.43,0:07:42.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You are being forced further and further away from your brother!Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.27,0:07:46.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.19,0:07:48.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this where it ends?Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.81,0:07:54.21,Main,,0,0,0,,No trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.69,0:07:57.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems that your fighting power has increased considerably,Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:07:59.84,Main,,0,0,0,,but I've already seen through all your tricks.Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.84,0:08:03.13,Main,,0,0,0,,From this distance there isn't even a ten thousand to one chance I will miss!Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.03,0:08:07.63,Main,,0,0,0,,No trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.63,0:08:09.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.49,0:08:12.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm saved...Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.76,0:08:15.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Jet Human Shield!Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.83,0:08:20.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! What're you doing, Straw Hat?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.32,0:08:22.70,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! He was the one who cut you!Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.70,0:08:26.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Besides, didn't you just say you'd come to help me?Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:30.49,Main,,0,0,0,,You dumbass! You only hear what you want to hear!Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:32.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.29,0:08:33.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Human Shield!Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.20,0:08:34.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.26,0:08:42.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable! You're Hawk Eye, aren't you?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.70,0:08:46.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Special Muggy Ball!Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:47.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Now get blown away!Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:51.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, or not.Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.67,0:08:56.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you know why the Muggy Ball is so popular with plumbers?Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:57.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.80,0:09:00.39,Main,,0,0,0,,All together now... because it goes...Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:02.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Boom!Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.65,0:09:04.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow. Buggyrific!Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:06.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:06.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Good one!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:09.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.50,0:09:11.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget you!Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.62,0:09:13.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.97,0:09:23.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Vista! The Old Man ordered us to to keep Ace's brother alive!Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.07,0:09:24.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Back him up!Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.61,0:09:26.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Understood. I'm on it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.97,0:09:39.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander of the Whitebeard Pirates' Fifth Division, Flower Blade Vista.Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:45.12,Main,,0,0,600,,Nice to meet you, Hawk Eye Mihawk. So you've heard of me?Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:44.53,Captions,,0,0,2,,5th Division Commander of the Whitebeard Pirates Flower Blade VistaDialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:48.40,Main,,0,0,0,,It would be strange if I had not.Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.17,0:09:52.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm saved!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.21,0:09:55.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's that old guy?Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:09:57.98,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not a Devil Fruit, or some cheap trick...Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.98,0:10:00.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever. I'm grateful!Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.61,0:10:10.25,Main,,0,0,0,,One by one, he turns the people around him into his allies.Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.27,0:10:16.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep going, Straw-Hat-boy!Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.69,0:10:22.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! You must save your brother!Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.12,0:10:27.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Move it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.36,0:10:31.74,Main,,0,0,0,,More than anyone else sailing the seas...Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.92,0:10:38.84,Main,,0,0,0,,that man possesses the most terrifying power.Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.84,0:10:43.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.94,0:10:49.63,Narrator,,0,0,0,,As the execution draws ever closer...Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:53.40,Narrator,,0,0,0,,a number of shocking truths have been revealed, one after another.Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.04,0:11:05.16,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Over two hundred men did the unthinkable and broke out of the impenetrable Impel Down...Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:09.81,Narrator,,0,0,0,,then these infamous, mighty prisoners appeared on the battlefield.Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:18.20,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The scene that has unfolded looks like something from a different world.Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:23.39,Narrator,,0,0,0,,This truly is an ultimate showdown that will determine the fate of the world!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.00,0:11:27.50,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The people around the world can only hold their breath...Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:32.94,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and watch as their futures are decided here.Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.54,0:11:46.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Fleet Admiral. The preparations are complete.Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.11,0:11:48.26,Main,,0,0,0,,The ones for the bay coast as well?Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.26,0:11:49.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. They're all ready.Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:55.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.03,0:11:58.30,Main,,0,0,0,,They're preparing to execute him...Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:12:00.45,Main,,0,0,0,,They're...Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.10,0:12:03.11,Main,,0,0,0,,What are they gonna do to Ace?Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.11,0:12:05.00,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not time yet!Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.91,0:12:10.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Is the execution gonna start now?Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.69,0:12:15.11,Main,,0,0,0,,That's impossible! The announced time is still a while off!Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.31,0:12:19.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut the broadcast on all Video Transponder Snails immediately!Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.07,0:12:28.59,Main,,0,0,0,,For the sake of Absolute Justice, the Navy and the World Government must win this battle at any cost...Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.15,0:12:32.18,Main,,0,0,0,,regardless of the methods we resort to.Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:36.65,Main,,0,0,0,,But this might be too much for the weak-willed commoners to handle.Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.65,0:12:41.99,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no need to show the world the tragedy about to take place.Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.41,0:12:44.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Old Man...Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:49.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.24,0:12:52.88,Main,,0,0,0,,They really are gonna execute Ace early!Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.29,0:12:56.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.83,0:13:01.03,Main,,0,0,0,,In a few hours we will tell the world...Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.49,0:13:03.50,Main,,0,0,0,,that we were victorious!Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.50,0:13:06.03,Main,,0,0,0,,That's all they need to know.Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.66,0:13:12.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Our ships were...Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:21.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at the bay! There's something out there!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.27,0:13:33.29,Main,,0,0,0,,They aren't our allies!Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.29,0:13:38.07,Main,,0,0,0,,The marines must have circled around behind the frozen waves to come from the coast!Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.07,0:13:42.72,Main,,0,0,0,,They still have men capable of destroying all those ships?Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.56,0:13:47.64,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.57,0:13:51.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are those guys?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.41,0:13:58.52,Main,,0,0,0,,So those are the Government's human weapons that I heard about...Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.42,0:14:08.53,Main,,0,0,0,,It's those Kuma-looking guys who were at the Sabaody Archipelago...Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.53,0:14:10.19,Main,,0,0,0,,There are that many of them?Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.06,0:14:17.87,Main,,0,0,0,,K-Kuma?Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.71,0:14:21.94,Narrator,,0,0,0,,About an hour and a half after the war began...Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:24.76,Main,,0,0,0,,the Navy gambled everything.Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.49,0:14:28.01,Main,,0,0,0,,In order to change the flow of the battle...Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.01,0:14:32.07,Main,,0,0,0,,they plunged into the final phase.Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.93,0:14:37.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.32,0:14:39.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I was tired of waiting!Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:42.43,Main,,0,0,0,,It's finally our turn!Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.37,0:14:57.93,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the Warlord, Bartholomew Kuma!Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:15:00.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are there so many of him?Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.23,0:15:03.05,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.04,0:15:15.86,Main,,0,0,0,,It's those things that wreaked havoc here on the Sabaody Archipelago a while back!Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.86,0:15:18.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Multiple Bartholomew Kumas...Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.93,0:15:21.37,Main,,0,0,0,,There are even more than there were before!Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.55,0:15:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Main Office! Main Office!Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:38.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Big news!Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:40.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Hello? Hello?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.53,0:15:49.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that the real one?Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.56,0:15:52.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard rumors about this.Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.94,0:15:57.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Doctor Vegapunk has been developing a human weapon.Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.17,0:16:01.06,Main,,0,0,0,,The prototypes were sent out to deal with various incidents.Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:04.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Are these the human weapons?Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.35,0:16:07.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Why do they all look like Kuma?Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:11.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey Uncle! This isn't what we planned!Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:18.12,Main,,0,0,0,,You were supposed to have the pirates surrounded in the bay before we got here,Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.82,0:16:21.29,Main,,0,0,0,,but they're scattered all over the place!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.05,0:16:27.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I figured out the Navy's plan.Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:33.98,Captions,,36,0,95,,Allied ShipsDialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:33.98,Captions,,30,0,380,,WhitebeardDialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:33.98,Captions,,30,0,560,,MarinesDialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:36.59,Main,,0,0,0,,First, they intentionally leaked their plans to execute Ace ahead of schedule, so we'd panic.Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.59,0:16:40.01,Main,,0,0,0,,After that, the enemy would slowly pull back,Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.01,0:16:43.23,Main,,0,0,0,,drawing the pirates into the bay after them.Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.23,0:16:46.84,Main,,0,0,0,,At that point, the human weapons would block our retreat and we'd be trapped.Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.91,0:16:48.62,Captions,,0,0,0,,Human WeaponsDialogue: 0,0:16:46.84,0:16:48.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Checkmate.Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.13,0:16:54.66,Main,,0,0,0,,So Old Man Whitebeard told us to attack the surrounding ships...Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:56.13,Main,,0,0,0,,because he saw this coming.Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.13,0:16:58.96,Main,,0,0,0,,And because of that, we aren't trapped.Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.25,0:17:06.01,Main,,0,0,0,,We may have lost the left and right flanks,Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.01,0:17:08.72,Main,,0,0,0,,but we can still trap them between us, from the front and back!Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.72,0:17:11.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Target the supporting pirate crews first, as planned.Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.88,0:17:16.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Eliminate everyone who slips past our defenses!Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.95,0:17:21.11,Main,,0,0,0,,As he says...Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.11,0:17:24.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Uncle, mind if some of our warships get destroyed, too?Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.60,0:17:27.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Try to keep it to a minimum.Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:29.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger that.Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.13,0:17:32.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get going!Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:36.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on...!Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.74,0:17:38.74,Main,,0,0,0,,but you won't take us down that easily!Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.32,0:17:57.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.48,0:18:15.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Go, Pacifista!Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.50,0:18:33.46,Main,,0,0,0,,They got us!Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:19:02.18,Main,,0,0,0,,So you don't think twice about sacrificing your own troops.Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:12.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't falter, men!Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.46,0:19:16.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Push forward into the plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:27.80,Main,,0,0,0,,All troops, get off the ice!Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.58,0:19:32.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Do not let the pirates reach the plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:34.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Fall back!Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:37.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.59,0:19:53.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What flower should I make bloom next?Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.76,0:19:56.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Drive them in, Pacifista!Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.27,0:19:58.78,Main,,0,0,0,,As if! Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.31,0:20:03.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Serves you right!Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.57,0:20:19.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with those things?Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:21.29,Main,,0,0,0,,It's like they're not even human!Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.29,0:20:22.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Are they invincible?Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.61,0:20:28.22,Main,,0,0,0,,The broadcast...Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.52,0:20:41.76,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter what you do...Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:45.08,Main,,0,0,0,,we still have the upper hand, Whitebeard.Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.36,0:20:51.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Once all of the broadcasts have been cut, mobilize the enclosure walls!Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.46,0:20:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Then we'll execute Ace and destroy the enemy all at once!Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.10,0:20:59.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Understood!Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.92,0:21:07.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Move it!Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.38,0:21:18.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace is in trouble! I gotta hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.42,0:21:23.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Back to where you started from!Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.33,0:21:26.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.28,0:21:37.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe.Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.89,0:21:44.75,Main,,0,0,0,,One of the admirals is here...Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.56,0:21:46.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.59,0:21:49.25,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a formidable foe, but we must hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.07,0:21:53.06,Main,,0,0,0,,You always knew that strong enemies would stand in your way,Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.06,0:21:56.82,Main,,0,0,0,,and you decided to come here anyway, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.06,0:22:02.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Die, Dragon's son!Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.23,0:22:13.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace's little brother! Are you already tired?Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.48,0:22:21.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the Division Commanders!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.26,0:22:24.19,Main,,0,0,0,,This makes things easier for us!Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.19,0:22:26.70,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't let one admiral stop you!Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.70,0:22:27.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Come with us!Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.73,0:22:30.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright! That bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.76,0:22:33.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance, while the marines are falling back!Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.35,0:22:35.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's break through their defenses!Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.93,0:22:40.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, now this looks like a tough bunch!Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.96,0:22:54.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander of the Tenth Division, Curiel!Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.69,0:22:59.16,Main,,0,0,0,,If you try to attack me, I'll simply crush you!Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.56,0:23:04.06,Main,,0,0,0,,But just staying in this bay makes your doom inevitable anyway!Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.06,0:23:09.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace will die, and with nowhere to run, you'll all be eliminated!Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.20,0:23:17.14,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn who wins, but I'd love to see Whitebeard die!Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.14,0:23:20.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let the Old Man or Ace die!Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.83,0:23:33.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Let us put our battle on hold, Vista.Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.21,0:23:37.26,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems that would benefit us both.Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.34,0:23:47.04,Main,,0,0,0,,We've been ordered to pull back, Smoker-san.Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.61,0:23:49.14,Main,,0,0,0,,This area is...Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.26,0:23:52.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.39,0:23:54.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I know.Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.97,0:23:57.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.01,0:24:08.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy... hurry to your brother!Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.09,0:24:16.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Have all the broadcasts been cut?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.60,0:24:18.66,Main,,0,0,0,,N-No, wait a little longer.Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.66,0:24:20.87,VideoTransmissionCaptions,,0,0,100,,Please stand by.Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.03,0:24:22.17,Main,,0,0,0,,We're ready over here!Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.28,0:24:23.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, move over to the side.Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.09,0:24:28.01,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought one screen was still broadcasting...Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.01,0:24:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's going on here?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.74,0:24:34.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Who is that over there?Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.97,0:24:38.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! Is that... Could it be...Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.86,0:24:41.58,Main,,0,0,0,,A man who hid his identity until now,Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.58,0:24:44.41,Main,,0,0,0,,but recently revealed himself as part of the legendary crew...Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.41,0:24:47.06,Main,,0,0,0,,that sailed with the Pirate King Gold Roger!Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.37,0:24:49.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's that?Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.10,0:24:53.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Is it really that great pirate, Buggy the Clown?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.45,0:24:57.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's me alright!Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.84,0:25:05.32,Main,,0,0,0,,This thing about me being a legendary pirate...Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.32,0:25:07.85,Main,,0,0,0,,was supposed to be a secret, but...Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.86,0:25:13.01,Main,,0,0,0,,W-wait, Captain Buggy! You've got a nosebleed!Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.51,0:25:19.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut! Cut!Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.45,0:25:20.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Wipe your face!Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.40,0:25:23.60,Main,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.16,0:25:28.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm ordering you to cut this ridiculous broadcast!Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.04,0:25:30.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't advance the plan!Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.92,0:25:38.20,Main,,0,0,0,,W-Well... a Video Transponder Snail was stolen by the Impel Down escapees!Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.22,0:25:41.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.95,0:25:43.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Makeup!Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.35,0:25:44.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.99,0:25:46.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, time for take two!Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.61,0:25:49.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Three! Two! One!Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.71,0:25:51.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Go!Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.08,0:25:53.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! Is that...Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.37,0:25:59.30,Main,,0,0,0,,the crewmate of the legendary Roger, and blood brother of Red Hair, one of the Four Emperors...Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.98,0:26:03.47,Main,,0,0,0,,is that the great pirate, Captain Buggy the Clown?Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.13,0:26:05.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's me alright!Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.33,0:26:09.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop them right now!Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.61,0:26:13.18,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close!Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.18,0:26:15.15,Main,,0,0,0,,They've found us! Run!Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.81,0:26:21.19,Main,,0,0,0,,It appeared that you were cut down by Hawk Eye Mihawk,Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.19,0:26:23.16,Main,,0,0,0,,but you're still standing! Who could you be?Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.06,0:26:25.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Who, me?Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.85,0:26:28.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Buggy!Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.60,0:26:31.25,Main,,0,0,0,,The legend!Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.25,0:26:34.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Blow them all to pieces!Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.03,0:26:36.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What's happening on the battlefield?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.71,0:26:38.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Why were the other broadcasts cut?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.95,0:26:41.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Show us Ace. He's about to be executed!Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.90,0:26:44.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Show us the Bartholomew Kuma army!Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.99,0:26:51.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.49,0:26:55.19,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't let ourselves be defeated before we've saved Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.19,0:26:56.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.82,0:26:57.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.22,0:27:19.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Old Man...Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.13,0:27:26.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Squard... You're all right.Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.15,0:27:28.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I survived, somehow.Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.02,0:27:31.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. I tried contacting you earlier...Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.72,0:27:33.93,Main,,0,0,0,,How are things going in the bay?Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.93,0:27:37.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Many of our allies are falling.Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.50,0:27:41.70,Main,,0,0,0,,If the Navy attacks from behind, it'll work to our advantage.Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.26,0:27:46.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going, too! We've got no choice but to make one last charge!Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.69,0:27:48.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right.Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.54,0:27:52.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Squard?Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.11,0:27:53.18,Main,,0,0,0,,What's he doing there?Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.18,0:28:00.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Forty-three ships are here to back you up. We all owe you a huge debt.Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.86,0:28:04.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We'd gladly lay down our lives for the Whitebeard Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:30.36,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing SewilDialogue: 0,0:00:36.30,0:00:42.27,Credits,,0,0,0,,Karaoke KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:30.83,0:00:35.70,Credits,,0,0,0,,QC Galaxy 9000 PepperjackDialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:46.14,Credits,,0,0,0,,Timing Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.94,0:00:49.58,Credits,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking HaleeDialogue: 0,0:00:52.45,0:00:55.69,Credits,,0,0,0,,Translation YibisDialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:01:00.46,Credits,,0,0,0,,Raws CruchyrollDialogue: 1,0:00:24.64,0:00:25.47,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 1,0:00:24.64,0:00:25.47,Kanji,,0,0,0,fx,雨Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.64,0:00:25.47,Kanji-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,あDialogue: 1,0:00:24.64,0:00:25.57,Kanji-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,めDialo